  m_Name: Level1(1-1)
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
  - What were you doing before you arrived at the museum...?
  - 'Oh, I was in the workshop, of course. The air was always filled with the scent
    of molten glass and the sound of craftsmen at work.  '
  - I remember the sunlight streaming through the windows, catching the colors of
    the glass as they shaped it into something beautiful.
  - "I was there when she\u2014when Claire\u2014and I brought our pi\xE8ce de r\xE9sistance
    to life. It was such a joyous time, though\u2026 I can\u2019t quite recall how
    I ended up here. It feels like I just\u2026 drifted away. \r\n"
  responses:
  - responseText: Your Work?
    dialogueObject: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 16d45f3dd9d33ea4e973fc826007faa6, type: 2}
    moodValue: 3
  - responseText: Return?
    dialogueObject: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4e4c5bce78379e140bbb1103a4a94e05, type: 2}
    moodValue: 0
